(Zoomy 5: the same language, written the way a manual reads.)
Create an array named scores
Let a number be called goal
Let a number be called passed

Please set scores to 72, 88, 95, 40.
Set goal to fifty.
First, put 61 at the end of scores.
scores must contain 95.
goal should be at least 10.

for each score in scores that are above goal:
    add 1 to passed

Is passed at least 3?
How many scores are above 80?
Print "all clear" if all of scores are above 30.
if there are no scores:
    print "nothing to do"
else if any of scores are below 50:
    print "somebody needs help"
otherwise print "everyone is fine"

Show "Good luck" twice.
